<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK</p>
<p>company results expected in week ending June 27 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS------RANGE--------PVS</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY, June 25</p>
<p>Greene King Plc    F   PFT	    35.9	   34.8-37.3  24.7</p>
<p>			     DIV	    16.3	   16.3-17.0  15.5</p>
<p>			     EPS	    46.0	   44.6-48.5  42.5</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's The Estimate Directory has a forecast of PFT 35.7 DIV 16.3 EPS 45.9)</p>
<p>Wessex Water Plc   F   PFT	   146.0	  144.4-147.4 133.9</p>
<p>			     DIV	    17.3	   17.2-17.8   15.2</p>
